  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "排程理論與應用",
    "sub_ename": "SCHEDULING THEORY AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "排程理論與應用是對於資源、活動或操作步驟等事先規劃與評估擬定優先處理順序並且將可用資源最佳化利用的一套演算法則。有效的排程方法能增加系統的效率及產能利用率且可節省時間浪費並增加系統或組織的利潤。在現今競爭激列的環境中，有效率的應用排程方法於機器、人力 資源、訂單加工順序和物料使用等等，將是必要的程序。Scheduling consists of planning and prioritizing activities that need to be performed in an orderly sequence of operation. It is a tool that optimizes use of available resources. Scheduling leads to increased efficiency and capacity utilization, reducing time required to complete jobs and consequently increasing the profitability of an organization. Efficient scheduling of resources such as machines, labor, order, and material is a must in extremely competitive environment.",
    "describe_eh": "Scheduling consists of planning and prioritizing activities that need to be performed in an orderly sequence of operation. It is a tool that optimizes use of available resources. Scheduling leads to increased efficiency and capacity utilization, reducing time required to complete jobs and consequently increasing the profitability of an organization. Efficient scheduling of resources such as machines, labor, order, and material is a must in extremely competitive environment.",
